 "about": {
  "text": "Na Hong-jin is one of the most exciting voices in South Korean cinema and, alongside directing greats such as Park Chan-wook and Bong Joon-ho, ensures that the most creative impulses for international genre cinema are consistently coming from South Korea. In Na Hong-jin’s case, this applies above all to action films. With his debut, *The Chaser*, he premiered at Cannes and wowed audiences with breathtaking car chases through the narrow alleys of Seoul. Since then, he has artfully played with genres and audience expectations, sparing no violence and letting the action delightfully escalate in carefully composed scenes. …",
  "lang": "en",
  "venue": "Xenix",
  "url": "https://www.xenix.ch/programm/dezember-2026/na-hong-jin",
  "translated": true
 },
